<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>TILL L4TE (feat. Pozer)</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="group" xml:id="v1">Aitch, Pozer</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">TILL L4TE (feat. Pozer)</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">3wZwJmK48mHwruBIK24oP2</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:00.040" end="00:01.880">Aitch, where's the Casamigos?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:01.880" end="00:03.910">Casamigos me, now take a shot if you're blessed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:03.910" end="00:07.530">I got hoes but I'm not Sheck Wes</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:07.530" end="00:09.200">Block delete then it's onto the next</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:09.200" end="00:11.180">The whole of the gang charged up like Prius (Bap, bap)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:11.180" end="00:12.870">You see us, I know we ain't takin' cheque</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:12.870" end="00:14.910">Tell the barman, bring us the Azul (Yeah, bring it, bring it)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:14.910" end="00:16.510">This bad one said, put it down her neck</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.510" end="00:18.360">I can't count bars but I'm countin' cheques</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:18.360" end="00:20.140">I used to trap, didn't get no rest</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:20.140" end="00:21.640">Ain't that time</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:21.150" end="00:22.880">Whip gets hot, I'ma take that fine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.880" end="00:24.800">Don't tell me about prof, 'cause I make back mine</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:24.800" end="00:26.530">Brought so many rocks, I done came back blind</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.530" end="00:28.390">So many shots had the table live</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:28.390" end="00:30.190">Try stunt on the gang, but you ain't that guy</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:30.190" end="00:32.440">Three whips, one boat, all I need is a jet</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:32.440" end="00:33.960">Boy, trust me, you ain't that fly</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.960" end="00:36.930">Ergh, Casamigos me, now take a shot if you're blessed (Shot that)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:36.930" end="00:38.520">Julio Don, Wray and his nef (Bap)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.520" end="00:40.480">Bill a scud, let it put me to bed (Bap, bap, bap, ergh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:40.480" end="00:42.120">High as a kite and I'm live on set</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:42.120" end="00:43.930">Smooth skin, waist slim</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.930" end="00:46.080">Hourglass shape with the figure of eight (Bap, bap, bap, bap, bap, ergh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.080" end="00:47.580">She hates that I'm doing this music ting</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:47.580" end="00:49.470">'Cause I don't come home, and I'm out till late</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:49.470" end="00:51.370">Out till late, count this cake</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:51.370" end="00:53.040">Me and AJ spent a house in Tape</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:53.040" end="00:54.940">Fine shit can't come to the shrubs</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.940" end="00:56.820">'Cause her tits too big so her outfit breaks</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:56.820" end="00:58.800">Got a tour bus fill up with tens (Yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.800" end="01:00.650">I throw fours up, big up the ends (Yeah)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:00.650" end="01:03.250">I ain't mad if your girl wanna twerk, but it ain't gonna work</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:03.250" end="01:04.750">Bitch where is your friends?</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.340" end="01:06.080">I like watching it shake like bass (I do)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.080" end="01:07.860">Up, down all over the place (Ergh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:07.860" end="01:09.540">I'll buy anything that you want no lay (I will)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.540" end="01:11.360">If you lock this year and call it a day</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.360" end="01:13.130">Block this bread, put it all in your case</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:13.130" end="01:15.060">Monaco main strip us was balling away</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:15.060" end="01:16.690">Two friends, one's riding the—</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:16.690" end="01:18.190">And the other one's all on my—</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:18.190" end="01:20.870">Ergh, Casamigos me, now take a shot if you're blessed (Bap, shot that)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.870" end="01:22.460">Julio Don, Wray and his nef</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:22.460" end="01:24.390">Bill a scud, let it put me to bed (Bap, bap, bap, ergh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:24.390" end="01:26.070">High as a kite and I'm live on set</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:26.070" end="01:27.800">Smooth skin, waist slim</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.800" end="01:29.870">Hourglass shape with the figure of eight (Bap, bap, bap, bap, bap, ergh)</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:29.870" end="01:31.490">She hates that I'm doing this music ting</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.490" end="01:33.350">'Cause I don't come home, and I'm out till late</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:33.350" end="01:35.240">Casamigos me, now take a shot if you're blessed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:35.240" end="01:37.070">Julio Don, Wray and his nef</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37.070" end="01:38.800">Bill a scud, let it put me to bed</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:38.800" end="01:40.640">High as a kite and I'm live on set</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:40.640" end="01:42.400">Smooth skin, waist slim</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:42.400" end="01:44.370">Hourglass shape with the figure of eight</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:44.370" end="01:46.150">She hates that I'm doing this music ting</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:46.150" end="01:48.070">'Cause I don't come home, and I'm out till late</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:48.070" end="01:56.070">Keep your eyes wide open every day to be sure</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:57.950" end="02:00.390">There's nobody creeping, please stay on course</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:00.390" end="02:03.080">Red bricks and Ket wigs, Strangeways on a tour</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:03.080" end="02:04.580">Hi from the Northside</p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="02:04.330" end="02:08.330">Bitch, I came from the 4</p></div></body></tt>